{"t":"n","a":82,"i":"a5d6b9af-3c13-429f-8f44-00b4ddf63e45","k":"external","n":"json","d":"Provides JSON serialization and deserialization for Go values.\n\nFunctions:\n\n* Marshal(v any) ([]byte, error): returns the JSON representation of the given value or an error if the value cannot be encoded.\n\n* MarshalIndent(v any, prefix, indent string) ([]byte, error): returns an indented (pretty‑printed) JSON representation of the given value or an error.\n\n* Unmarshal(data []byte, v any) error: parses the JSON data into the supplied pointer and returns an error if parsing or type conversion fails.\n\nTypes:\n\n* Encoder{w io.Writer} – has a method Encode(v any) error that writes the JSON encoding of v to the writer.\n\n* Decoder{r io.Reader} – has a method Decode(v any) error that reads the next JSON value from the reader and stores it in v.\n\nAll functions return an error describing the failure and nil on success.","p":"external:json","tg":["description:agent","layer:dependency","source:tree-sitter"]}
