{"t":"n","a":368,"i":"80992ec3-fc05-479f-b2d8-1d6c0db3fd6d","k":"module","n":"OmegaServ Host Configuration","d":"Defines the NixOS system configuration for the omegaServ host. It imports the generated hardware configuration and shared NixOS modules, sets the hostname and timezone, creates a normal user \"carol\" with sudo access, and enables a suite of services including WireGuard VPN, a Minecraft server, the Continuwuity chat server, Nextcloud AIO, ntfy notification server, Docker daemon (with custom data root), and an OpenSSH server listening on port 23 with hardened settings. Filesystem mounts for root, boot, and home partitions as well as swap and kernel module lists are also specified.","p":"hosts/omegaServ","r":146,"tg":["evidence:source","lang:nix","layer:architecture","source:arch-agent"]}
{"t":"n","a":369,"i":"ff2d107a-469e-48bb-8a6d-d6899f2a0eea","k":"file","n":"configuration.nix","d":"NixOS host configuration for the omegaServ server, defining system identity, firewall ports, enabled services (SSH, WireGuard, Minecraft, Docker), user accounts with a home-manager setup for carol, trusted users, timezone, state version, and unstable package source.","p":"hosts/omegaServ/configuration.nix","r":368,"tg":["lang:nix","source:tree-sitter"]}
{"t":"n","a":370,"i":"d260b151-e67a-4eb6-b883-dfcf936dcaa6","k":"variable","n":"continuwuity","d":"continuwuity = {\n  enable = true;\n  # Fixed by the database adopted from the old Arch box's conduwuit\n  # container: every user and room id in it carries this suffix.\n  serverName = \"chat.benmac.xyz\";\n  acmeEmail = \"acme@benmac.xyz\";\n};","p":"hosts/omegaServ/configuration.nix","r":388,"sp":[18,24,1,7],"sh":"1b771819a8252042f4ff5fb12c9abe71fb34315d6f8a7f9938322a0aa2e34a65","tg":["description:declaration","lang:nix","source:tree-sitter","visibility:public"]}
