{"t":"n","a":565,"i":"33264e58-0c7e-46f1-a0a4-9af5e27142e3","k":"module","n":"Desktop Environment Home Manager Configuration","d":"Aggregates Home Manager settings for a user's desktop environment, conditionally enabling GNOME Dconf tweaks, Hyprland components (Waybar, rofi, hyprpaper, graphide-shell, etc.), the SwayNC notification service, and XDG portal support based on OS configuration flags. It imports the appropriate sub-modules, configures environment variables, installs helper packages, and defines session settings required for each supported environment.","p":"modules/home-manager/desktop/env","r":468,"tg":["evidence:source","lang:nix","layer:architecture","source:arch-agent"]}
{"t":"n","a":566,"i":"837dad5a-807d-4f75-b486-c7b7dff10334","k":"subsystem","n":"modules/home-manager/desktop/env — Desktop environment settings","d":"Pure Nix definitions for the desktop environment, aggregating window‑manager configuration and related components.","p":"modules/home-manager/desktop/env","r":476,"tg":["evidence:signatures","layer:overview","overview:rung:directory","source:overview-agent"]}
{"t":"n","a":567,"i":"07862177-6fd8-46c5-8fee-aab8720c920b","k":"file","n":"default.nix","d":"Aggregates Home Manager desktop environment configurations by importing the Gnome, Hyprland, and XDG environment modules.","p":"modules/home-manager/desktop/env/default.nix","r":565,"tg":["lang:nix","source:tree-sitter"]}
{"t":"n","a":568,"i":"5970dd9d-a431-45f6-b9ca-b91b8dbd443b","k":"variable","n":"imports","d":"imports = [\n  ./gnome.nix\n  ./hyprland.nix\n  ./xdg.nix\n];","p":"modules/home-manager/desktop/env/default.nix","r":567,"sp":[3,7,3,5],"sh":"ee8f55ef2cdf3bb9ff70b6710c3318ef9729eac70405cbef526edc89529152e4","tg":["arch:auto-attached","description:declaration","lang:nix","source:tree-sitter","visibility:public"]}
{"t":"n","a":569,"i":"8c5283ca-6278-4af0-a760-291996583ba4","k":"file","n":"gnome.nix","d":"Provides Home Manager GNOME desktop environment configuration, exposing a conditional dconf attribute set with GNOME-specific settings (e.g., dark theme, favorite apps, keybindings) and a helper flag that detects whether the GNOME desktop manager is enabled.","p":"modules/home-manager/desktop/env/gnome.nix","r":565,"tg":["lang:nix","source:tree-sitter"]}
{"t":"n","a":570,"i":"6f01dcc2-19c2-45ba-b0dc-34676334784b","k":"variable","n":"dconf","d":"dconf = {\n  enable = lib.mkIf gnomeEnabled true;\n  settings = lib.mkIf gnomeEnabled {\n    \"org/gnome/desktop/interface\".color-scheme = \"prefer-dark\";\n    \"org/gnome/shell\".favorite-apps = [ \"firefox.desktop\" \"foot.desktop\" ];\n    \"org/gnome/desktop/wm/keybindings\" = {\n      activate-window-menu = \"disabled\";\n      toggle-message-tray = \"disabled\";\n      close = [ \"<Super>q\" ];\n      maximize = \"disabled\";\n      minimize = [ \"<Super>comma\" ];\n      move-to-monitor-down = \"disabled\";\n      move-to-monitor-left = \"disabled\";\n      move-to-monitor-right = \"disabled\";\n… (truncated)","p":"modules/home-manager/desktop/env/gnome.nix","r":569,"sp":[8,40,3,5],"sh":"21b0af38b524c3b2f3417503a641311d2b19bd8709fe2ad899793ac7a3c19ea5","tg":["arch:auto-attached","description:declaration","lang:nix","source:tree-sitter","visibility:public"]}
{"t":"n","a":571,"i":"0332450b-d5c5-4dec-bc15-dd8841076092","k":"variable","n":"enable","d":"enable = lib.mkIf gnomeEnabled true;","p":"modules/home-manager/desktop/env/gnome.nix","r":570,"sp":[9,9,5,41],"sh":"5f5928e939ff3aab0d842427e380f5183d91d37bc3a3f983dda46b050d2f562d","tg":["description:declaration","lang:nix","source:tree-sitter","visibility:public"]}
{"t":"n","a":572,"i":"ee95d2dd-786d-4ac5-b3d0-67a7140fc28c","k":"variable","n":"gnomeEnabled","d":"gnomeEnabled =\nlib.attrByPath [ \"services\" \"desktopManager\" \"gnome\" \"enable\" ] false osConfig;","p":"modules/home-manager/desktop/env/gnome.nix","r":569,"sp":[4,5,3,84],"sh":"2de219bfa29188d9feb26a6dfca88d320c99524d04485c2e3b839d0168ce996e","tg":["arch:auto-attached","description:declaration","lang:nix","source:tree-sitter","visibility:public"]}
{"t":"n","a":573,"i":"12820f28-36fc-4e89-926a-8b05479b1523","k":"variable","n":"settings","d":"settings = lib.mkIf gnomeEnabled {\n  \"org/gnome/desktop/interface\".color-scheme = \"prefer-dark\";\n  \"org/gnome/shell\".favorite-apps = [ \"firefox.desktop\" \"foot.desktop\" ];\n  \"org/gnome/desktop/wm/keybindings\" = {\n    activate-window-menu = \"disabled\";\n    toggle-message-tray = \"disabled\";\n    close = [ \"<Super>q\" ];\n    maximize = \"disabled\";\n    minimize = [ \"<Super>comma\" ];\n    move-to-monitor-down = \"disabled\";\n    move-to-monitor-left = \"disabled\";\n    move-to-monitor-right = \"disabled\";\n    move-to-monitor-up = \"disabled\";\n    move-to-workspace-down = \"disabled\";\n… (truncated)","p":"modules/home-manager/desktop/env/gnome.nix","r":570,"sp":[10,39,5,7],"sh":"cd9ebcd97983c58310428400e12ec94013a5ce39fcb301ffc80c0ca410b25886","tg":["description:declaration","lang:nix","source:tree-sitter","visibility:public"]}
{"t":"n","a":574,"i":"f198f9de-a7af-4593-82d7-991890c2351f","k":"file","n":"hyprland.nix","d":"Exports Hyprland desktop‑environment setup for Home Manager, offering command‑path variables and a conditional config block that enables rofi, hyprpaper, waybar and related desktop entries, and aggregates the Hyprland‑specific module imports.","p":"modules/home-manager/desktop/env/hyprland.nix","r":565,"tg":["lang:nix","source:tree-sitter"]}
{"t":"n","a":575,"i":"dba15b67-170e-4d5d-9a44-36bfa57c7cfd","k":"variable","n":"brightnessctl","d":"brightnessctl = \"${pkgs.brightnessctl}/bin/brightnessctl\";","p":"modules/home-manager/desktop/env/hyprland.nix","r":574,"sp":[5,5,3,61],"sh":"c2cd69c279c84ea2f308f741871fe69408a491189994c939c3ffb1681a38b68c","tg":["arch:auto-attached","description:declaration","lang:nix","source:tree-sitter","visibility:public"]}
{"t":"n","a":576,"i":"7ccf2907-43b8-46ce-8e30-a9ff4392338a","k":"variable","n":"config","d":"config = lib.mkIf osConfig.programs.hyprland.enable {\n  programs.rofi.enable = true;\n  services.hyprpaper.enable = true;\n  programs.waybar.enable = true;\n  xdg = {\n    desktopEntries.\"org.gnome.Settings\" = {\n      name = \"Settings\";\n      comment = \"Gnome Control Center\";\n      icon = \"org.gnome.Settings\";\n      exec = \"env XDG_CURRENT_DESKTOP=gnome ${pkgs.gnome-control-center}/bin/gnome-control-center\";\n      categories = [ \"X-Preferences\" ];\n      terminal = false;\n    };\n  };\n  home.sessionVariables = {\n    WLR_NO_HARDWARE_CURSORS = \"1\";\n    XCURSOR_SIZE = \"48\";\n… (truncated)","p":"modules/home-manager/desktop/env/hyprland.nix","r":574,"sp":[21,384,3,5],"sh":"2ec1a98e43b9b830f20d0ef509f440884bcce8ba517bc5d1a26ff7bcb8c8070e","tg":["arch:auto-attached","description:declaration","lang:nix","source:tree-sitter","visibility:public"]}
{"t":"n","a":577,"i":"1ea4acc1-0b9b-4013-bbfd-c14a40e03cb0","k":"variable","n":"graphideShell","d":"graphideShell = lib.attrByPath [ \"programs\" \"graphide-shell\" \"enable\" ] false config;","p":"modules/home-manager/desktop/env/hyprland.nix","r":574,"sp":[10,10,3,88],"sh":"96987623a6d9cf15a6f16a0bad9d8f9ea985ea2bf5574c759e5d1206a9a775a3","tg":["description:declaration","lang:nix","source:tree-sitter","visibility:public"]}
{"t":"n","a":578,"i":"17b7a19d-4222-4dc5-bb66-8ecfdbc46796","k":"variable","n":"home.packages","d":"home.packages = [\n  #\n  pkgs.wlsunset\n  pkgs.grimblast\n  pkgs.ydotool\n  pkgs.wlr-randr\n  pkgs.networkmanagerapplet\n  pkgs.playerctl\n  (pkgs.writeShellScriptBin \"devbright\" ''\n    val=$(${brightnessctl} get)\n    max=$(${brightnessctl} max)\n    h=\"$(printf \"%02x\\n\" \"$((val*255/max))\")\"\n    mice=$(${pkgs.libratbag}/bin/ratbagctl | ${pkgs.coreutils-full}/bin/cut -d: -f1)\n    if [[ -n $mice ]]; then\n      while read -r mouse; do\n        ${pkgs.libratbag}/bin/ratbagctl \"$mouse\" led 0 set color \"$h$h$h\"\n     done <<< \"$mice\"\n    fi\n  '')\n  (pkgs.writeShellScriptBin \"bwfloat\" ''\n… (truncated)","p":"modules/home-manager/desktop/env/hyprland.nix","r":576,"sp":[40,127,5,7],"sh":"42cb8290b468ee54392a4f398d356bed0d92968b305420804935c66b6b799299","tg":["description:declaration","lang:nix","source:tree-sitter","visibility:public"]}
{"t":"n","a":579,"i":"377fac64-958d-4014-9fe0-da25bce4df52","k":"variable","n":"home.sessionVariables","d":"home.sessionVariables = {\n  WLR_NO_HARDWARE_CURSORS = \"1\";\n  XCURSOR_SIZE = \"48\";\n  NIXOS_OZONE_WL = \"1\";\n};","p":"modules/home-manager/desktop/env/hyprland.nix","r":576,"sp":[35,39,5,7],"sh":"c2b62d614ffb05755de4cfddc1973257606ce00b8d501af251e4b152a5d6b747","tg":["description:declaration","lang:nix","source:tree-sitter","visibility:public"]}
