{"t":"n","a":664,"i":"9cda11e2-d546-4690-baa6-cb0b95f6f464","k":"function","n":"main","d":"Takes a list of command‑line arguments `args`. Calls `inline_unlock` with `args` and then calls `rbw` with the result of `inline_unlock`; returns the value returned by `rbw`. Propagates any exception raised by either helper.","p":"modules/home-manager/desktop/env/wm/quickshell/shell/vault.py","r":661,"sg":"def main(args):","lt":"[\"unlock-inline\",\"ok\",\"locked\",\"entries\",\"message\",\"Could not unlock. Check your password and try again.\",\"list\",\"unlock\"]","sp":[119,158,1,60],"tg":["description:agent","lang:python","source:tree-sitter","visibility:public"]}
