{"t":"n","a":666,"i":"83c17488-32c2-4480-b149-974785410457","k":"function","n":"rbw","d":"Takes any number of positional arguments that are passed as command‑line arguments to the external `rbw` program, and an optional keyword `capture` (bool, default False). Executes `rbw` with the given arguments. If `capture` is True, returns the command’s standard output as a string; otherwise returns None. Propagates any `OSError` or non‑zero exit status as a raised exception.","p":"modules/home-manager/desktop/env/wm/quickshell/shell/vault.py","r":661,"sg":"def rbw(*args, capture=False):","lt":"[\"rbw\"]","sp":[113,116,1,76],"tg":["description:agent","lang:python","source:tree-sitter","visibility:public"]}
