{"t":"n","a":797,"i":"f9184862-0e07-4bfe-afc0-6348a5be18c5","k":"file","n":"office.nix","d":"Home Manager desktop module that adds an \"office\" option to enable a suite of office productivity tools and related packages, including LibreOffice, TeX Live, speedcrunch, hunspell, anki, and enables Zathura as the default PDF viewer.","p":"modules/home-manager/desktop/office.nix","r":475,"tg":["lang:nix","source:tree-sitter"]}
