{"t":"n","a":1079,"i":"936170d8-544a-4bf6-ad01-58d25a81bfa4","k":"module","n":"NixOS System Configuration","d":"Provides a NixOS configuration module that assembles system-wide settings—boot loader, networking, services, package set, automatic upgrades—and imports supporting sub-modules (head, serv, tailscale). It also defines an \"onTheGo\" specialization for portable hardware, exposing a custom flake attribute and integrating Home Manager and optional Tailscale support.","p":"modules/nixos","r":1080,"tg":["evidence:source","lang:nix","layer:architecture","source:arch-agent"]}
{"t":"n","a":1080,"i":"a7269081-807e-4631-a8c3-80393f75a156","k":"subsystem","n":"modules/nixos — System‑wide NixOS configuration","d":"Top‑level NixOS modules defining global system settings and exposing services to host configurations.","p":"modules/nixos","r":468,"tg":["evidence:signatures","layer:overview","overview:rung:directory","source:overview-agent"]}
{"t":"n","a":1081,"i":"00009e90-b94d-4fda-b556-b43e5ae69ea3","k":"file","n":"default.nix","d":"Default NixOS module that establishes core system settings (systemd‑boot, network manager, firewall port ranges, printing, locales, fonts, nix gc and autoUpgrade), imports the shared module fragments (home-manager, ./head, ./serv, ./tailscale.nix), defines a custom flakeAttr option for flake naming, and provides an alias to the unstable package set.","p":"modules/nixos/default.nix","r":1079,"tg":["lang:nix","source:tree-sitter"]}
{"t":"n","a":1082,"i":"2d577f64-2caa-43df-89f5-027559a68b7f","k":"variable","n":"boot.kernel.sysctl.\"vm.swappiness\"","d":"boot.kernel.sysctl.\"vm.swappiness\" = lib.mkDefault 10;","p":"modules/nixos/default.nix","r":1085,"sp":[48,48,5,59],"sh":"3d51f84269d60370075151c76bf0442a46b341b1be2ee702acc21784bfa91ec1","tg":["description:declaration","lang:nix","source:tree-sitter","visibility:public"]}
