{"t":"n","a":1401,"i":"5f112658-e7d9-4f47-a1ca-c5d1a926802f","k":"file","n":"you-have-mail.nix","d":"NixOS module that configures the you-have-mail email notification observer, exposing options for accounts, polling, and ntfy notifiers, generating a runtime configuration file with secret handling, installing a setup script, and defining the systemd services for config rendering and the observer process.","p":"modules/nixos/serv/you-have-mail.nix","r":1213,"tg":["description:agent","evidence:source","lang:nix","source:tree-sitter"]}
